WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.200
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:20.070
Rental Magica

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:28.050
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:37.730
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:42.430
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:47.370
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:53.350
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:59.050
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:04.730
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:09.360
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:14.200
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:19.170
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:24.240
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.980
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:33.720
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:40.220
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:48.140
As neither Goetia nor Astral were able
to destroy the core as contracted,

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.630
the contract for that job is still in effect.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.110
There'll be another Magi Night like that?

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:54.900
Yes.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.570
Is there something you wish to ask me?

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:04.550
Yes. May I confirm something, please?

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.650
Be my guest.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.930
There are rumors that a mage
of Goetia committed a taboo.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:24.230
It's not like The Association
to listen to rumors like that.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:28.340
We've been tracing the origin of the
spell power which caused that Night.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:33.110
It goes back 4 months,
to the Welsh region of the U.K.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:38.220
I believe a Goetia studio is
built on top of that ley line.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:43.120
It's normal to built a studio atop a ley line.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.150
Indeed.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:50.930
Then what about how, also 4 months ago
during the first Magi Night in Wales,

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:56.460
Goetia's former leader and several mages
died accidentally at that same studio.

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.610
You've done a fantastic job
covering it up, haven't you?

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:05.750
What if a mage committed a
taboo by becoming magic,

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.940
then merged with the ley line and came to Japan?

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.180
I... don't know anything about that...

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:20.460
I saw nothing!

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:25.500
President Iba?

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:29.260
Adelicia and I both fell into
that sea, but I saw nothing!

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.600
I see.

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.630
So...

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.170
Is that how it is?

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:44.570
If the president of Astral says so, then
there's nothing to be gained by arguing.

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.580
Goetia, Astral, please continue the contract.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.460
I wish you good magic.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.250
I'm wiped out.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.600
Brother Pres, that was awesome!

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.390
You drove off Uncle Kagezaki!

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.300
A brilliant interruption, sir.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:06.930
Now what, President Pushover?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.740
President Pushover?

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.530
Aren't you?

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.700
I guess I am.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:18.180
But I promised Adelicia I wouldn't say anything.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:20.680
Itsuki...

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.920
I'm indebted to you.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:32.260
But that doesn't factor into this bid.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.390
Addie, what are you going to do?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:40.340
Aren't you weakened from fighting
that mage of yours last night?

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.380
I'll be fine on my own.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.340
You're going to fight him alone?!

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:49.840
No, I know how powerful you are, Adelicia, but...

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.380
Then what are you trying to say?

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.860
Just that you should have a slightly
more certain way to do it.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.050
So why not work with us?

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.630
You mean join forces with you people?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:07.230
Yeah. It'll be best for your father's sake, too.

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.830
For Father's sake...

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:16.240
Episode 6
GLAM SIGHT

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:18.200
No!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:21.440
This amount of money is a compromise.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.750
T-That amount is impossible!

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:28.180
If this is a joint operation between Goetia
and Astral, the terms should be equal!

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:33.390
Even saying that, Goetia in this case
is just you. Astral is four people.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:37.860
It may be a joint operation in name,
but we have most of the burden.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.260
I'm including Forneus and Eligor in the deal!

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.570
Then how about a bonus for all the blood spilled?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.600
What?! We didn't even spill a drop of blood!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:55.380
First off, where does a company at your
level get off asking a price like this?!

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:56.580
Boss.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.850
A joint operation.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:08.590
Just how much of a pushover are you?

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.160
Boss, I'm sorry.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:15.940
Huh?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.740
I thought it was a regular Magi Night.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:21.940
I never thought that was going to happen.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.210
I'm sorry for being nothing
but a drag on everyone.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.340
Listen, can I ask you something?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.650
Why did you join Astral, Honami?

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:40.490
With your powers, you would have gotten
offers from other magical groups.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:45.230
I mean... No matter how you look at it,
we're just a small company.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.700
You said "we."

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:51.670
Has the company president
in you awakened a bit?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:55.430
Awakened? D-Don't tease me like that!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.070
It's because you were here, Icchan.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:06:59.740
Huh?

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.450
Nothing.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:12.220
Were you okay?

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.430
Y-Yeah.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:18.030
Nekoyashiki's charm and my
company badge protected me.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:22.900
Your spiritual resistance
is higher than I thought.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.760
R-Really.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.110
Itsuki!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:29.300
That guy is really overcharging me!

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.000
He's a stubborn onmyouji, that one!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.150
Mr. President! I need your signature on this!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.710
Right, right.

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.820
You're not hiding anything
else from me, are you?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.060
Nothing.

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:56.760
If you hurt our president's
feelings, I won't be happy.

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:02.140
I know. That's why I...

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.610
Adelicia is going to be the bait?!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.540
So, how are you going to lure him out?

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:16.950
To fully become Solomon's magic,
Father has to consume all 72 demons.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.890
The remaining ones are in my control.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:27.220
Father will cross any obstacle to devour them.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.800
Do you know where he'll appear next?

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:33.230
He's limited to moving along the ley lines.

00:08:33.710 --> 00:08:38.540
After last night's Magi Night, that became
certain when he merged into the ley line.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:42.580
I think he's moving from the
haunted factory in the southwest...

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.880
...to an amusement park to
the northeast, in Niuyama.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.280
So, what should Astral do?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:08.410
I'll now draw out the mage who
is behind the core of the Night.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:12.610
Mikan will then isolate him with a barrier,

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:19.950
leaving Honami and the pig-headed
onmyouji to deal with the mage himself.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.590
A mage who has made himself into magic...

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:26.220
We won't be able to take
him on in the usual ways.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:31.730
What we can do is have Addie's demons
distract it while we launch a surprise attack.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.400
If he starts summoning any demons,
we bug out of there immediately.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.270
Boss, we're ready.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.170
Roger.

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:49.650
So, in the end, my job is to play scout
and report the progress of the battle, huh?

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.340
Adelicia? What's up?

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.020
How are things on your end?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.450
We're just about ready.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.360
Good. Me, too.

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.200
No, there's still one thing to do.

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.870
I have to apologize to you, Itsuki.

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:13.600
Huh?

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.950
Apologize? To me?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.450
Even now, I still love my father.

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:30.910
Father?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:51.740
You know what they'll say about him...

00:10:52.850 --> 00:10:54.940
That he was a fool who was consumed by magic.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:11:01.990
I won't let anyone say that his reaching
for that level was worthless.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:07.420
I didn't come here to bury my father's corpse.

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:11.260
I came here to preserve my father's honor.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:14.690
You truly loved him, didn't you?

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.510
My letting my personal feelings into this
disqualifies me from being the boss.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.840
Then I'm not qualified, either.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:21.700
Huh?

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:25.080
Because I understand how you feel, Adelicia.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:48.630
I have come to devour you!

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:58.750
Adelicia!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:05.850
My dear Addie...

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:13.150
My dear Addie...

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:19.530
You've brought it to me. Now I can be complete.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:25.610
I didn't bring it for you.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.270
Then why?

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.700
To smash your delusions.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:38.780
Mikan!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:43.790
Even though I am most impure,
I ask that you cleanse me and grant clarity,

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.780
both within and without.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.460
What?!

00:12:57.970 --> 00:12:58.900
South star, north star!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:11.750
Father...

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:24.590
Come forth, Forneus!
The marquis who rules 29 legions!

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:31.200
Father, let's go home.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.820
He's absorbed Eligor's powers?

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:02.630
He can assume the shape of any demon,
depending on his needs?

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.570
This is insane.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.700
A mage who has failed to become magic...

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:14.340
You're too soft-hearted, Addie.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:22.520
Adelicia!

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:26.720
That voice... I see.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:29.650
You are here, too.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:32.530
The one with that fascinating eye!

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.140
That bird!

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:40.900
Boss!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:09.930
Boss!

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:12.740
Are you okay?

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.740
H-Honami!

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.880
Get back to the others...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:22.880
I can't!

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.280
Forget me! Hurry!

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:39.260
Humans are so fragile.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:42.070
Father...

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:44.300
Addie...

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.370
Father, please!
Don't disgrace yourself any more!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:50.070
Disgrace?

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:54.310
I came to protect your honor!

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.180
Honor?

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.980
Yes. So please, Father...

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:05.450
If you wish to protect my honor,
then let me devour you!

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.860
Be my good little girl, Addie...

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.130
Adelicia!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.100
What?!

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.670
Hail! Goddess of the moon!

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:29.070
By the cone of power and divine protection
of mistletoe! Strike the evil to the north!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.390
Useless!

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:35.520
Celtic magic is no match for that of Solomon!

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:44.730
Honami! Adelicia!

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:53.000
Give energy to my spirit with these gifts.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.140
We can't win.

00:16:59.550 --> 00:17:02.740
Even if I was a mage, even Honami
and the others can't beat that.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.020
A man who has become magic itself!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.620
Are you satisfied with this?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:09.410
What?!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:11.790
Brother Pres, that was awesome!

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:14.480
You drove off Uncle Kagezaki!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:17.750
You said "we."

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:20.490
Has the company president
in you awakened a bit?

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:25.770
That eye... Your eye... I like that eye!

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.760
I want it!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.800
Are you satisfied with this?

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:33.170
No, of course I'm not.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.340
Then look!

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.980
Look at him!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:46.790
Look at everything!

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.130
I'll look! I'll look! I'll look!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:56.830
Give it to me! Give me that eye!

00:17:58.170 --> 00:17:59.900
Boss! No!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.170
This is... This is my job!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.310
Give it to me!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.390
What?!

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.200
What are you?

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.500
You can anticipate my moves?

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.210
Nekoyashiki! Mikan! Honami!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.940
As your president, I order you!

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.810
Can you see through this?!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.980
Nekoyashiki, left diagonal, 26 degrees,
6 meters ahead! Fire line charm!

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:54.660
Mikan, directly horizontal to me,
42 degrees to 84 degrees! Misogi!

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:55.560
Right!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.790
Honami! Right, 64 degrees to 70 degrees!
Mistletoe arrows!

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:01.560
Hail!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.230
Itsuki's eye...

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.940
Since it allows him to see the flow of spell power,

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:12.170
it lets him dodge an opponent's attack.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:16.440
He can see a magical creature's pleasure,
rage, or sorrow with just a glance.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:17.980
Glam Sight.
Glam Sight.

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.350
Glam Sight!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:23.480
Don't look at me!

00:19:33.430 --> 00:19:34.870
Don't look at me!

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:45.710
What did you see?

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:57.420
You devoured your students,
trampled on your own daughter...

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:02.230
Atone for your vanity!

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:27.320
My dear... Addie...

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.620
Father.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:35.290
Adelicia wanted to protect your good name.

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:10.790
Boss!

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:20.700
I... stepped on it with my broken leg.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:23.300
Idiot.

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.770
Really.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:38.490
The sky's so blue, so why am I such a mess?

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:41.620
That's what you get for taking off your eyepatch.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:45.590
Sorry.

00:21:45.770 --> 00:21:50.760
Still, thanks to you, we didn't
have to break up Astral.

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:53.310
Good job.

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:55.800
Big Sister Honami, you're so strict.

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.000
M-My pleasure.

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.840
Honami, could I have a moment?

00:22:03.120 --> 00:22:04.010
Yes?

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:09.450
I turned in a written report to Kagezaki.

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.750
Did he grill you for every detail?

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:14.220
Well, I managed to dodge most of them.

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:15.790
I see.

00:22:17.760 --> 00:22:19.130
Glam Sight.

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:23.400
The legendary demon eye which
can see through magical beings.

00:22:33.550 --> 00:22:34.540
Itsuki...

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:48.230
In the end, whatever sort of magic
you use or demon you summon,

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.990
it consists of the quality of
spell power and how it flows.

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:54.670
Glam Sight allows you to see through all that,

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:59.070
to know an opponent's movements,
abilities, and weaknesses in an instant.

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:03.040
Nekoyashiki, what do you think?

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:09.310
While I'd like to say this is a plus for Astral,
I'm not completely happy about it.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:13.420
An eye which sees too much will
consume the soul of the one who owns it.

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:15.380
Right.

00:23:18.990 --> 00:23:22.720
No matter what happens, I swear...

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:23.590
Hm?

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:26.760
I will protect Icchan.

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:46.010
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:54.420
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:23:55.700 --> 00:24:07.470
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:19.390
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:24:19.390 --> 00:24:25.660
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:30.160
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:24:31.030 --> 00:24:34.430
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:24:34.430 --> 00:24:39.530
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:24:40.470 --> 00:24:51.410
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:24:51.790 --> 00:24:55.460
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:24:55.460 --> 00:24:59.690
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:24:59.790 --> 00:25:02.790
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:25:04.230 --> 00:25:05.070
Homunculus

00:25:05.070 --> 00:25:06.400
Homunculus
What's a homunculus?

00:25:06.400 --> 00:25:10.130
Homunculus
A humanoid life form created by alchemy.
It means "little human."

00:25:10.300 --> 00:25:10.860
Little?

00:25:10.940 --> 00:25:11.910
Long ago.

00:25:11.910 --> 00:25:13.640
Nowadays, they can be different sizes,
according to the one who makes them.

00:25:13.640 --> 00:25:16.380
So, could you have one as big as 40 meters tall?

00:25:16.380 --> 00:25:17.410
What do you think, Prof. Miwa?

